<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Improve performance" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Improve performance</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Process commands fast. Experience high-performance network connection via PROFINET IO IRT and transfer internal data with up to 100 Mbps. Easily record analog values and output as of 50 µs and digital values and output as of 1 µs.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Maintain connectivity" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Maintain connectivity</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Ensure reliable and rapid data exchange with Open Ethernet communication (TCP/IP, UDP, ISO-on-TCP), and communicate effectively via PROFINET, PROFIBUS, IO-Link, Modbus RTU, Modbus TCP, PtP, ASCII, 3964R and USS.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Scale your operations" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Scale your operations</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Independent of the environment, each Distributed Controller can be extended by a bunch of directly connectable modules, standard and failsafe, digital and analog inputs/outputs, motos starters, communication and technology.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='7yJx9IDCnDv58HFM3kOdS7' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_4' data-ste-section-id='7yJx9IDCnDv58HFM3kOdS7'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-7yJx9IDCnDv58HFM3kOdS7" class="CardsContainer" data-component-type="CardsContainer"><section id="7yJx9IDCnDv58HFM3kOdS7" class="cards-defaultBackground" role="region" aria-labelledby="section-heading-7yJx9IDCnDv58HFM3kOdS7"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Featured capabilities</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="row cards-container-row"><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="SIMATIC ET 200SP Open Controller" id="G_SIMATIC%20ET%20200SP%20Open%20Controller-0" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_SIMATIC%20ET%20200SP%20Open%20Controller-0-title" aria-describedby="G_SIMATIC%20ET%20200SP%20Open%20Controller-0-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_SIMATIC%20ET%20200SP%20Open%20Controller-0-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">SIMATIC ET 200SP Open Controller</h3><div id="G_SIMATIC%20ET%20200SP%20Open%20Controller-0-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>The SIMATIC ET 200SP Open Controller is the first controller of its kind to combine the functions of a PC-based SIMATIC S7-1500 software controller with PC applications, central I/Os and optional visualization in a compact device.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="SIMATIC ET 200SP CPUs" id="G_SIMATIC%20ET%20200SP%20CPUs-1" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_SIMATIC%20ET%20200SP%20CPUs-1-title" aria-describedby="G_SIMATIC%20ET%20200SP%20CPUs-1-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_SIMATIC%20ET%20200SP%20CPUs-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">SIMATIC ET 200SP CPUs</h3><div id="G_SIMATIC%20ET%20200SP%20CPUs-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>The compact distributed controllers ET 200SP CPUs are the perfect solution for standard and fail-safe applications, especially for machines with distributed intelligence or series machines with limited space.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="SIMATIC ET 200pro CPUs" id="G_SIMATIC%20ET%20200pro%20CPUs-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_SIMATIC%20ET%20200pro%20CPUs-2-title" aria-describedby="G_SIMATIC%20ET%20200pro%20CPUs-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_SIMATIC%20ET%20200pro%20CPUs-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">SIMATIC ET 200pro CPUs</h3><div id="G_SIMATIC%20ET%20200pro%20CPUs-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>For use cases outside a cabinet (IP 65/67) the SIMATIC ET 200pro system is perfectly suited. Available as standard and failsafe controllers this system can be mounted directly at the machine level e.g. a conveyer belt rack.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-asse